{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2020-02", "window": 2, "start_date": 1581120000, "end_date": 1581724799, "month_true_total": 2351, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:00:03 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "63514141", "author": {"steamid": "76561198356159806", "personaname": "booga12354", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198356159806/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 320595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 26812, "last_played": 1645481961, "avatar": "47a3d1425fc9c5740c775ee740ba2d24263adfcc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun, massive amount of movement options and choices in gameplay(though if you want to do the puzzle aspects yourself you may have to turn on solo). Good story that is well spread out, still haven't finished all quests. \nMoney wise you can pay to skip some grind which is most of the reason for playing, you can pay for cosmetics and lastly what you should buy regardless is slots, which increases the number of different items you can hold(which is still earnable but slow ingame)", "timestamp_created": 1581724626, "timestamp_updated": 1581724626, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "63513954", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088102772", "personaname": "Water", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/djonez41/", "num_games_owned": 572, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 237610, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 108467, "last_played": 1786852555, "avatar": "4c521bdf15955a93d5a3e4dc5fd06ae696ce48cd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space ninja magic and guns, guns, guns! WHAT MORE DO YOU NEED!", "timestamp_created": 1581724287, "timestamp_updated": 1581724287, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "63513892", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057937234", "personaname": "ALEXZ_DA_GREAT", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198057937234/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2500, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 566, "last_played": 1614913307, "avatar": "274f03b19bafa55fe53596303f7170d198c81bed"}, "language": "english", "review": "After Nine hours of playing on PC and me playing over 1000 hours on PS4, I can say the community is still as nice and helpful as they ever were back then and they were also helpful in helping me grind up some items that I require to enjoy the game more than ever and I only hope to continue the grind and keep playing the game with friends and randoms.\nBy yourself?\nNo.\nWith people? \nMost entertaining game out there that is free comparing it to games such as destiny is like comparing ants to a ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ god!\nI can only say this game is very very fun and the only problems I can see with it is if your the type of player whos impatient with the crafting system that takes a day to craft items or your not interested in grinding.\nThis game is great for people with little time on their hands that can only input like 30 mins a day into the game, they can go to work and know that later down the line their stuff is going to be ready for the next time they play and they can continue to enjoy that game as usual.", "timestamp_created": 1581724180, "timestamp_updated": 1581724180, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "